273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 166 0 R
/E (Pretrained VGG16 provides the best balance between accuracy, training time, and stability for both medical and non-medical image classification. Fine-tuning can improve peak performance, but it increases the risk of overfitting, especially for small medical datasets. Training deep CNNs from scratch is not suitable when the dataset size is limited. This study confirms that transfer learning is essential for achieving reliable and efficient performance in practical deep learning applications.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
